  "worked_solution": "Isolating the cubic term, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(5-2x)^{3}-60 & \\ge 4 \\\\ (5-2x)^{3} & \\ge 64.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we take the cube root of both sides and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{(5-2x)^{3}} & \\ge \\sqrt[3]{64} \\\\ 5-2x & \\ge 4 \\\\ -2x & \\ge -1 \\\\ x & \\le \\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
